('6d2b9935-decb-5933-ba5f-7cf33be6ea15'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 1)', 'Microbiology', 'Entamoeba histolytica causes:', '["Leishmaniasis","Amebic dysentery","Giardiasis","Malaria","Trichomoniasis"]'::jsonb, 'Amebic dysentery', 'E. histolytica causes amebic dysentery and liver abscess. It ingests RBCs (erythrophagocytosis).'),
