('753d2955-f222-5854-b27e-0176e0ddd0d0'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 1)', 'Microbiology', 'Which species of Plasmodium causes the most severe malaria?', '["P. knowlesi","P. falciparum","P. malariae","P. ovale","P. vivax"]'::jsonb, 'P. falciparum', 'P. falciparum causes the most severe malaria with cerebral malaria, ARDS, and renal failure.'),
