('7fb70d0c-6bb4-5ed9-8a49-f96dd91a9557'::uuid, 'Pathology (Paper 1)', 'Microbiology', 'Primaquine is used to:', '["Treat cerebral malaria","Treat drug-resistant malaria","Prevent mosquito bites","Prevent relapse by eliminating hypnozoites","Treat acute malaria"]'::jsonb, 'Prevent relapse by eliminating hypnozoites', 'Primaquine eliminates hypnozoites of P. vivax and P. ovale in the liver to prevent relapse.'),
